<view class="page">
  <view class="hint-box">
    <text class="hint-title">在地图上依次点击，连成路线</text>
    <text class="hint-body">第一个点自动成为起点，最后一个点成为终点。至少 2 个点。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="map-wrap">
    <map
      id="pickMap"
      class="map"
      latitude="{{latitude}}"
      longitude="{{longitude}}"
      scale="{{scale}}"
      polyline="{{polyline}}"
      markers="{{markers}}"
      show-location
      bindtap="onMapTap"
    ></map>

    <view class="counter">
      <text class="counter-num t-num">{{points.length}}</text>
      <text class="counter-label">个点</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="toolbar">
    <view class="tool-btn" bindtap="onUndo">撤销一点</view>
    <view class="tool-btn" bindtap="onClear">全部清空</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">路线名称</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        value="{{name}}"
        placeholder="例如：九曲发夹弯"
        placeholder-class="input-placeholder"
        maxlength="40"
        bindinput="onNameInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">路宽</text>
      <picker
        mode="selector"
        range="{{roadWidthLabels}}"
        value="{{roadWidthIndex}}"
        bindchange="onRoadWidthChange"
      >
        <view class="picker">
          <text>{{roadWidthLabels[roadWidthIndex]}}</text>
          <text class="picker-arrow">›</text>
        </view>
      </picker>
    </view>

    <view class="note">
      距离、弯道数、急弯占比、爬升、难度星级由后端根据坐标自动计算
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="btn btn-primary {{submitting ? 'btn-disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onSubmit">提交路线</view>
</view>
